><span =\"font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;\">（<\/span><span =\"font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;\">3）具备良好的职业道德与专业素质，已通过证券、基金等从业资格考试优先。<\/span><\/span><\/p>\n<p =\"text-indent: 32pt; line-height: 28pt; margin: 0pt 0pt 0.0001pt; text-align: justify; font-family: Calibri; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span =\"font-family: 楷体_GB2312; font-size: 14px;\"><span =\"font-family: 楷体_GB2312;\">（四）招聘流程<\/span><\/span><\/p>\n<p =\"text-indent: 32pt; text-align: left; line-height: 28pt; margin: 0pt 0pt 0.0001pt; font-family: Calibri; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span =\"font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; font-size: 14px;\"><span =\"font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;\">各环节于<\/span><span =\"font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;\">2026年9月至2027年4月滚动进行<\/span><\/span><\/p>\n<p =\"text-indent: 32pt; line-height: 28pt; margin: 0pt 0pt 0.0001pt; text-align: justify; font-family: Calibri; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span =\"font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; font-size: 14px;\"><span =\"font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;\">1.宣讲与网申<\/span><\/span><\/p>\n<p =\"text-indent: 32pt; line-height: 28pt; margin: 0pt 0pt 0.0001pt; text-align: justify; font-family: Calibri; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span =\"font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; font-size: 14px;\"><span =\"font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;\">候选人可登录中信证券股份有限公司官网，网申投递简历；或选择扫描二维码进入移动端进行快速投递。<\/span><\/span><\/p>\n<p =\"text-indent: 32pt; line-height: 28pt; margin: 0pt 0pt 0.0001pt; text-align: justify; font-family: Calibri; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span =\"font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; font-size: 14px;\"><span =\"font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;\">2.简历筛选<\/span><\/span><\/p>\n<p =\"text-indent: 32pt; line-height: 28pt; margin: 0pt 0pt 0.0001pt; text-align: justify; font-family: Calibri; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span =\"font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; font-size: 14px;\"><span =\"font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;\">根据应聘者综合背景与应聘岗位的匹配度进行初步筛选。<\/span><\/span><\/p>\n<p =\"text-indent: 32pt; line-height: 28pt; margin: 0pt 0pt 0.0001pt; text-align: justify; font-family: Calibri; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span =\"font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; font-size: 14px;\"><span =\"font-family: 仿宋_GB2312;\">3.在线测评与面试<\/span><\/spa